.TH geectl-request-decline 1  "geectl-request-decline 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-request\-decline \- Decline a submit request, with a comment as the reason
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl request decline\fR [\fB\-\-comment\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Decline a submit request, with a comment as the reason
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-comment\fR \fI<COMMENT>\fR [default: ]
The reason for the decline. Values starting with `\-` are taken literally: a comment may open with a `\- ` bullet
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
The request id
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
